<Base title='Privacy and your choices'><div class="container"><div class="page-intro"><p class="eyebrow">The publication</p><h1>Privacy and your choices</h1></div><article class="prose section"><p>Optional Google Analytics 4 is available on the production site only after you allow analytics. Newsletter subscriptions and ad serving remain disabled while AdSense review is pending. Google Search Console and AdSense ownership verification tags do not load tracking scripts. The contact form may send information to Netlify when its processing is enabled; form storage and owner email notifications are separate services.</p><h2>Information on this device</h2><p>Saved campground IDs, checklist entries, cost estimates and analytics preferences can be stored in your browser. They are device-specific, do not sync to an account and can be cleared using the tools or browser settings. Shareable budget links include numeric costs only; directory filter links can contain the selected filters and search terms.</p><h2>Optional analytics</h2><p>The production site uses Google Analytics 4 with a basic consent model: no analytics requests before acceptance. You can reject analytics or change your choice using Privacy preferences in the footer. Analytics sends allowlisted event context and canonical page paths, not email addresses, contact messages or query strings. Enhanced measurement and Google signals are disabled. It is not a complete visitor census. Google processes permitted analytics data under its <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>; see <a href="https://business.safety.google/privacy/">how Google uses data from partner sites</a>.</p><h2>Newsletter and inquiries</h2><p>When enabled, newsletter email and selected interests are sent through our server-side adapter to the explicitly selected Beehiiv publication. Allowlisted campaign context, page and signup placement may accompany a new subscription. Existing subscriptions are not rewritten by repeat requests. Unsubscribe using the provider’s email links.</p><p>Contact information is intended only to answer inquiries, investigate corrections and prevent abuse. Do not submit payment information or sensitive personal records. Use the contact form to request access to or deletion of an inquiry. Inquiries are stored in Netlify for publisher review; no automatic deletion schedule is currently configured.</p><h2>External services</h2><p>Netlify hosts the site and may process request and security logs under its own service policies. Interactive explorer maps load OpenStreetMap tiles when they enter view, sharing ordinary request information with that service. Other location maps load when opened. Search and filters run locally against our campground collection; searches are not sent to a geocoding service. REI shopping links use impact.com affiliate tracking. Clicking an affiliate link may share request information and set tracking cookies on the partner’s services to attribute a qualifying purchase. External shopping, booking and rental sites have their own privacy policies. No affiliate tracking pixel is loaded just by reading our pages.</p></article></div></Base>
